<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Agouron rated strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Agouron rated strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst Doug Lind, who recently joined the firm from PaineWebber, initiated coverage of Agouron Pharmaceuticals Inc as strong buy.</p>
<p>-- shares closed up 4-3/4 on news the U.S. Food and Drug Administration gave it clearance to market the company's HIV protease inhibitor VIRACEPT in the United States, under the provisions of the FDA's accelerated approval process.</p>
